  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add shallots and ginger and sauté until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add barramundi fillet and cook for 3-4 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Remove barramundi from pan and set aside.",
    "Deglaze pan with lemon juice, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom.",
    "Add fish sauce and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Return barramundi to pan and simmer for 2-3 minutes, or until coated in the creamy sauce.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve hot."
